docs {
  # bookings:declineOffer (MUTATION)
  
  Mahasiswa menolak tawaran sesi
  
  Mengubah status booking dari `offered` menjadi `declined`.
  
  ## Parameter (`args`)
  - `bookingId` (string, Wajib): ID booking tawaran sesi
  - `actorUserId` (string, Wajib): ID akun mahasiswa
  
  ## Pemanggilan di React (Convex Hook)
  ```ts
  const declineOffer = useMutation(api.bookings.declineOffer);
  await declineOffer({ bookingId: "bk-example", actorUserId: "user-learner-demo" });
  ```
}
